+  }
+
+protected:
+  /**
+   * Loads all native methods of this `HybridObject` to be exposed to JavaScript.
+   * The base implementation registers a `toString()` method and `name` property.
+   *
+   * Example:
+   *
+   * ```cpp
+   * int User::getAge() {
+   *   return 23;
+   * }
